#: includes/class-profile-fields.php:48
msgid "Pushover user key"
msgstr "Pushover-Benutzerschlüssel"

#: includes/class-profile-fields.php:56
msgid "Install the Pushover app, open it and copy the user key shown on its main screen. Leave empty to stop being a possible recipient."
msgstr "Installiere die Pushover-App, öffne sie und kopiere den Benutzerschlüssel von ihrem Hauptbildschirm. Leer lassen, um keine Benachrichtigungen mehr zu erhalten."

#. translators: %s: reason returned by Pushover
